  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.555,
    "end": 11.516,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What's wrong with the fashionable shoes?",
    "start": 12.416,
    "end": 16.058,
    "zh": "这双时髦的鞋子怎么了？",
    "zh_hant": "這雙時髦的鞋子怎麼了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Do you have any shoes like these?",
    "start": 17.959,
    "end": 21.821,
    "zh": "你有像这样的鞋子吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你有像這樣的鞋子嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "What size?",
    "start": 22.041,
    "end": 23.462,
    "zh": "什么尺码？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼尺碼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "five.",
    "start": 23.642,
    "end": 25.563,
    "zh": "五。",
    "zh_hant": "五。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "What colour?",
    "start": 25.803,
    "end": 27.063,
    "zh": "什么颜色？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼顏色？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Black.",
    "start": 27.304,
    "end": 28.344,
    "zh": "黑色。",
    "zh_hant": "黑色。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I'm sorry.",
    "start": 28.965,
    "end": 30.245,
    "zh": "很抱歉。",
    "zh_hant": "很抱歉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "We don't have any.",
    "start": 30.165,
    "end": 32.146,
    "zh": "我们没有。",
    "zh_hant": "我們沒有。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "But my sister bought this pair last month.",
    "start": 32.807,
    "end": 37.069,
    "zh": "但我姐姐上个月买了这双。",
    "zh_hant": "但我姐姐上個月買了這雙。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Did she buy them here?",
    "start": 37.449,
    "end": 39.71,
    "zh": "她是在这里买的吗？",
    "zh_hant": "她是在這裡買的嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "No, she bought them in the U. S.",
    "start": 39.99,
    "end": 43.752,
    "zh": "不，她是在美国买的。",
    "zh_hant": "不，她是在美國買的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "We had some shoes like those a month ago,",
    "start": 44.293,
    "end": 48.274,
    "zh": "一个月前我们有像那样的鞋子，",
    "zh_hant": "一個月前我們有像那樣的鞋子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "but we don't have any now.",
    "start": 48.595,
    "end": 51.536,
    "zh": "但现在没有了。",
    "zh_hant": "但現在沒有了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Can you get a pair for me, please?",
    "start": 51.776,
    "end": 55.378,
    "zh": "你能帮我弄一双吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你能幫我弄一雙嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I'm afraid that I can't.",
    "start": 55.598,
    "end": 58.119,
    "zh": "恐怕不行。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕不行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "They were in fashion last year",
    "start": 58.52,
    "end": 61.401,
    "zh": "去年它们很流行，",
    "zh_hant": "去年它們很流行，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "and the year before last.",
    "start": 61.541,
    "end": 64.002,
    "zh": "前年也是。",
    "zh_hant": "前年也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "But they're not in fashion this year.",
    "start": 64.102,
    "end": 67.784,
    "zh": "但今年它们不流行了。",
    "zh_hant": "但今年它們不流行了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "These shoes are in fashion now.",
    "start": 69.065,
    "end": 72.106,
    "zh": "现在流行的是这些鞋子。",
    "zh_hant": "現在流行的是這些鞋子。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "They look very uncomfortable.",
    "start": 73.027,
    "end": 76.288,
    "zh": "它们看起来很不舒服。",
    "zh_hant": "它們看起來很不舒服。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "They are very uncomfortable.",
    "start": 76.408,
    "end": 79.389,
    "zh": "它们确实很不舒服。",
    "zh_hant": "它們確實很不舒服。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "But women always wear uncomfortable shoes!",
    "start": 79.41,
    "end": 83.869,
    "zh": "但女人总是穿不舒服的鞋子！",
    "zh_hant": "但女人總是穿不舒服的鞋子！"
  }
]
